summary:
On June 3, 2024, Kelly Garcia, Executive Vice President and Chief Technology Officer of Domino's Pizza Inc (NYSE:DPZ), sold 2,200 shares of the company. The transaction was documented in a recent SEC Filing. Following this sale, the insider now owns 8,148.552 shares of Domino's Pizza Inc.

Warning! GuruFocus has detected 5 Warning Sign with VRTX.

Domino's Pizza Inc operates as a pizza delivery company globally. It is involved in retail sales of food through company-owned Domino's Pizza stores;
